n<p>Comes with a nifty tool bag that fastens around the waist, and can be adjusted to fit up to a 25? waist child. Made from machine-washable fabric that promises fuss-free cleaning, with plenty of slots and pockets that will motivate our little ones to keep neat and organised at all times!</p>','h',0,'2023-12-30','2023-12-30',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/‎holztiger-80333-allosaurus-1.‎001.png\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/allosaurus-wooden-figurine/'),(30,0,'RAINBOW CLOUD WOODEN PACIFIER CLIP','','','t',0,'0000-00-00','0000-00-00',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/GOKI-65275-1.jpg\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/rainbow-cloud-wooden-pacifier-clip/'),(31,0,'SAILBOAT WOODEN PACIFIER CLIP','','','t',0,'0000-00-00','0000-00-00',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/GOKI-65276.jpg\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/sailboat-wooden-pacifier-clip/'),(32,0,'CAR WOODEN PACIFIER CLIP','','','t',0,'0000-00-00','0000-00-00',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/GOKI-65198.jpg\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/car-wooden-pacifier-clip/'),(33,0,'PINK HEARTS WOODEN PACIFIER CLIP','','','t',0,'0000-00-00','0000-00-00',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/GOKI-65216.jpg\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/pink-hearts-wooden-pacifier-clip/'),(34,0,'BLUE STAR WOODEN & SILICONE PACIFIER CLIP','','','t',0,'0000-00-00','0000-00-00',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/GOKI-65241.jpg\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/blue-star-wooden-silicone-pacifier-clip/'),(35,0,'PINK HEART WOODEN & SILICONE PACIFIER CLIP','','','t',0,'0000-00-00','0000-00-00',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/GOKI-65240.jpg\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/pink-heart-wooden-silicone-pacifier-clip/'),(36,0,'AMBER-BEADED WOODEN PACIFIE