com/product/three-wise-men-wooden-figurine-caspar/'),(98,2,'263PC DOMINO RACE BUILDING SET','263-piece domino race building set with tracks, bridges, ramps, and accessories. Kids can design creative domino courses, trigger chain reactions, and learn basic engineering concepts while playing.','Build exciting chain-reaction tracks with the 263PC Domino Race Building Set. This creative construction toy allows kids to design their own domino racing courses using a variety of colorful pieces, including domino blocks, ramps, bridges, and track connectors.\n\nChildren can experiment with different layouts, build multi-level tracks, and watch the satisfying domino effect as one piece triggers the next. The set encourages creativity, logical thinking, and early STEM learning by introducing concepts such as gravity, motion, and cause-and-effect.\n\nMade with durable and safe materials, the pieces are easy to assemble and suitable for repeated play. Kids can build simple lines or complex domino racing systems, making every play session a new challenge.','t',0,'2026-03-12','2026-03-12',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/HABA-1172-Domino-Race-5.jpg\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/263pc-domino-race/'),(99,0,'HABA MARBLE RUN SYSTEM: 42PC BASIC TRACK SET','','','t',0,'0000-00-00','0000-00-00',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/HABA-1136-Basic-Track-Set-7.jpg\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/haba-marble-run-system-42pc-basic-track-set/'),(100,0,'ANGEL WITH STAR WAND WOODEN NATIVITY FIGURINE','','','t',0,'0000-00-00','0000-00-00',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/holztiger-80288-angel-with-star-wand-1.001.png\r','https://www.thebettertoystore.com/product/angel-with-star-wand-wooden-figurine/'),(101,0,'RED DRAGON WOODEN FIGURINE','','','t',0,'0000-00-00','0000-00-00',1,'https://www.thebettertoystore.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/holztiger-80280-red-dragon-1.001.png\r','h